WEBVTT

00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:02.626
My giving circle,

00:07:02.626 --> 00:07:05.838
we give as you would to a loved one,

00:07:05.838 --> 00:07:07.548
looking them in the eyes.

00:07:08.883 --> 00:07:11.594
And unlike most
of traditional philanthropy,

00:07:11.635 --> 00:07:14.346
we give with no strings attached,

00:07:14.346 --> 00:07:17.141
literally shifting the power

00:07:17.141 --> 00:07:20.102
into the hands
of the leaders on the ground,

00:07:20.144 --> 00:07:23.522
so they can decide
how to best use the money.

00:07:24.398 --> 00:07:28.194
(Applause)

00:07:28.194 --> 00:07:31.614
Because community knows
what community needs.